197	## Extract接口调用示例
198	**关键点**: Extract接口要求索引为`uint32_t`类型，通过`ReinterpretCast<uint32_t>()`将LocalTensor<int32_t>转换为LocalTensor<uint32_t>
199	```cpp
200	{
201	    auto sortedUb = inUb1;
202	    auto scoreUb = outUb1;
203	    auto indexUb = outUb2;
204	    auto indexUbU32 = indexUb.ReinterpretCast<uint32_t>();
205	    AscendC::Extract(scoreUb, indexUbU32, sortedUb, static_cast<int32_t>(repeatTimes)); // repeatTimes为待分离的score-index对数32对齐后再除以32
206	    WaitVDone();
207	}
